[I] SysV mail/BSD Mail/POSIX mailx: send and receive Internet mail

[T] SysV mail/BSD Mail/POSIX mailx: send and receive Internet mail.

[U] https://www.sdaoden.eu/code.html#s-mailx

[A] S-nail Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 14.9.25
[L] BSD

[D] d3d72cbe759e3d1afd5cce6c632f8d476fd45e9eefab8ad30d0f9ab3 s-nail-14.9.25.tar.xz https://ftp.sdaoden.eu/

var_append makeopt ' ' "VAL_PREFIX=/$prefix VAL_SYSCONFDIR=$sysconfdir VAL_MANDIR=$mandir"
var_append makeopt ' ' "VAL_MAIL=/var/spool/mail VAL_MTA=/usr/sbin/sendmail"
atstage cross && var_append makeopt ' ' OPT_CROSS_BUILD=y
var_append makeopt ' ' "config build"
